    "name": "Escape From Duckov",
    "steam_appid": 3167020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b15bf8f53fec8f8c47a4dc4970f8e009.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking up from a strange dream, you find yourself in Duckov's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various enemies hiding outside around your shelter. After leaving, you need to explore cautiously and try to collect supplies for your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no time to explain, rookie duck!  Becoming a stronger soldier is what you need most now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fighting Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't defeat them head-on? How about some back-stabbing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cruel world, do what's best to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring The Areas</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the maps! Whatever they are, take them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building the Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build this base of your own.\u00a0Make the empty basement busy. Medical stations, armament racks, gyms and a cozy duck nest, it's all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizing Your Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you find in the maps can be made into powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Making Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with all the NPCs, and gradually discover the truth about this world. Is there a friend or enemy ahead waiting for you? Better beware, good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, explore this last habitable land of the duck paradise, and find out the truth about Duckov!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b15bf8f53fec8f8c47a4dc4970f8e009.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking up from a strange dream, you find yourself in Duckov's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various enemies hiding outside around your shelter. After leaving, you need to explore cautiously and try to collect supplies for your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no time to explain, rookie duck!  Becoming a stronger soldier is what you need most now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fighting Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't defeat them head-on? How about some back-stabbing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cruel world, do what's best to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b35ec210544c92e8f5470b35d7b02c0c.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring The Areas</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot the maps! Whatever they are, take them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/b94e6787ece8706b9e26ef13408f3c57.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building the Base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build this base of your own.\u00a0Make the empty basement busy. Medical stations, armament racks, gyms and a cozy duck nest, it's all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/e22dd3508fcaaaa1afe41be3afe17708.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customizing Your Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The items you find in the maps can be made into powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/354a9cab24f1bf486cd8ff13fa09b39e.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Making Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with all the NPCs, and gradually discover the truth about this world. Is there a friend or enemy ahead waiting for you? Better beware, good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.poster.avif?t=1755225638\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.webm?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167020/extras/67f38fd2f52a10ee29a324ee2722f564.mp4?t=1755225638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, explore this last habitable land of the duck paradise, and find out the truth about Duckov!</p>",
    "short_description": "A single-player top-down looter-shooter game. Loot, escape, build, and eventually become a mighty bird soldier. Beware! If you are knocked down, items in your inventory will be lost! But don't worry. With your infrastructure built nicely, you will rise again soon.",
